                <note rend="inline" type="source">360F.1163 Church of Jesus Christ/9:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Czechoslovakia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Benton</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Prague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-10-22T14:00:00+01:00">October 22, 1934—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received October 22—12:44 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>54. My number 49, October 11, 4 p.m. Arthur Gaillardth [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gaeth</hi>] informs me case has been satisfactorily settled.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Benton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
